+# Wave 2 local WIP checkpoint: not independently reviewed
+
+Canonical base: e54523517d0f03e58352e647c403a5af3e525a57.
+Branch: research/continuous-20261110-continuations.
+Package: research/coded-whole-row-services.
+Worker: dispatcher. Track50. This checkpoint is unfinished research, not a
+reviewed contribution or a production numerical-header implementation.
+
+## Implemented, with bounded executed corroboration
+
+rows.py emits four entry points of one seven-symbol graph with273w+125 states
+for fixed productive width w>=2. No runtime B, row count R or depth is compiled
+into that graph. One specific protected payload role G holds a canonical
+zero-row format guide; the existing child_header stages that guide across the
+unchanged Controller/Stack boundary. Root format production F_format(B) remains
+a named supplied-input obligation. It is not the e/f/K/rho production header.
+
+Classification reads one actual formatted row. Installation stripes complete
+rows among all w productive fields; collection checks every returned field
+and its matching component layout, then interleaves rows before actual pop.
+Transport permits arbitrary canonical signed-component row layouts. The actual
+scalar-provider binding uses complete complex pairs, as #6968 requires.
+
+Candidate exact transition bills (read/write/unit move/halt each one) passed:
+
+    classify =8B+9; prepare=9B+8;
+    install=13RB+4R+R/w+9B+3w+12;
+    collect=13RB+4R+R/w+4w+4.
+
+Adding all unchanged Controller administration gives the proposed nonleaf
+boundary invoice, with q payload tapes, b saved-PC bits, parent occupied
+sum S, child occupied sum C, and L=RB:
+
+    4S+5C+57L+8R+2R/w+31B+38q+27b+7w+136.
+
+This includes classification but excludes numerical child time, literal
+Controller instruction dispatch, separate RET top tests, and supplied-input
+production. It does not improve kappa or discharge a selected assumption.
+
+Executed coverage in RESULT.json:64 row-service cases,16 extra one-row leaf
+classifiers,7 actual Controller/Stack replays with #6968 SCALE(-1) leaves,
+57 ordinary boundaries,4160 independently specified short guide/data pairs,
+and16 negative controls. Widths2..5 are tested for row services; Controller
+fixtures use w2/3/4, depths0..3, translated prefixes, dirty initial work, and
+warm blank histories. All original admin terms and every new callback are
+measured separately and recomposed. A first odd-component scalar fixture was
+correctly rejected by the retained complex provider; fixtures now use pairs.
+
+## Reproduce and remaining work
+
+    python3 -I -B research/coded-whole-row-services/verify.py
+
+Expected: PASS_CODED_WHOLE_ROW_SERVICES64 7 4160 16 (spaces after the status).
+The explicit --write-result flag regenerates the frozen receipt; default
+execution is read-only. Retained bytes authenticate before source-byte exec,
+so no stale pyc can bypass the pins.
+
+Unverified at this checkpoint: the quantified proof, historical-capacity
+envelope, exact model-interface exposition, full task/source/VERIFY metadata,
+independent lead review and publication checks. The actual code and all-size
+claims must not be advertised as reviewed yet. Next: finish PROOF.md with
+format/parser, complete-row, suspended-owner and cost inductions; add metadata
+and limitations; execute registered normal/optimized verification; request
+cross-review before the scientific freeze. Exclude variable-rank recursion,
+non-power homogeneous roots, remainders/padding and production descriptors.
